          "kind": "text",
          "value": "N students watched a patriotic movie. An analyst wishes to ask each student whether\nthey liked the movie or not. Each student can either answer the question or refuse to\nrespond. In how many ways, can the analyst get responses from the students?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Give an expression in the stated parameters."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "type": "short_answer",
      "acceptable_answers": [
        "3^N",
        "3**N"
      ],
      "explanation": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Each student has three possible responses: liked, disliked, or no response."
        }
      ]
